        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Review user access data for security and compliance issues:\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.users?.slice(0, 100) || $json, null, 2) }}\n\nAnalyze for:\n1. Excessive permissions (principle of least privilege violations)\n2. Dormant accounts (no login > 30 days but active permissions)\n3. Orphaned accounts (no manager, terminated employees)\n4. Privilege accumulation (users with too many roles)\n5. Segregation of duties violations\n6. Service accounts with unnecessary access\n\nProvide JSON:\n{\n  \"totalUsers\": number,\n  \"anomalies\": [\n    {\n      \"userId\": \"id\",\n      \"userName\": \"name\",\n      \"issue\": \"description\",\n      \"riskLevel\": \"high|medium|low\",\n      \"recommendation\": \"action to take\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"dormantAccounts\": number,\n  \"overPrivileged\": number,\n  \"segregationViolations\": number,\n  \"complianceScore\": 0-100,\n  \"recommendations\": [\"top recommendations\"]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [440, 300],
      "id": "ai-access",
      "name": "AI Review Access",
      "credentials": {
        "anthropicApi": {
          "id": "anthropic-credentials",
          "name": "Anthropic account"
        }
      }
